<title>UK: Deutsche Schiffsbank sets 100 mln Dem step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Schiffsbank sets 100 mln Dem step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE SCHIFFSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.0	 MATURITY   *07.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.25    PAY DATE    07.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    BREMEN    DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO 07.MAY.98, THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR STEPS UP TO</p>
<p>		4.5 PCT TO 07.MAY.99, 5.0 PCT TO 07.MAY.00, 5.50 PCT</p>
<p>		TO 07.MAY.01 AND 6.0 PCT TO MATURITY</p>
<p>	     INHABERSCHREIBUNG SERIES 226</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
